SELECT 'Guide', f.id, $kb76$guide-calendar$kb76$, $kb77$Calendar — everything due, in one view$kb77$, $kb78$Tasks, follow-ups, meetings, reviews, SIP dates, campaigns and compliance dates on a month or week calendar.$kb78$, $kb79$The calendar collects every dated item you are responsible for.

![Calendar](shot:1)

## Use the calendar

1. Open **Work → Calendar**. It opens on the current month.
2. Use **← Sept** and **Nov →** to move between months, or switch **Month View** and **Week View**.
3. The coloured chips (**Task**, **Follow-up**, **Meeting**, **Review due**, **SIP**, **Campaign**, **Compliance**) show how many of each fall in the month. Click a chip to show or hide that kind.
4. Click an item on a day to open it.

## Sync to your own calendar

Click **Sync to Calendar** to connect these items to your own calendar app.$kb79$, $kb80$[{"storageKey":"/kb/calendar.jpg","caption":"Month view with coloured chips for each kind of event.","alt":"Month view with coloured chips for each kind of event."}]$kb80$::jsonb, 2, true, now(), 4
