4. Use the icons at the end of a row to message, call or open the client.

A gap means no active or in-progress policy of that type for the client or anyone in their family. **Cover needed** is an indicative estimate by client segment, not a precise Human Life Value — confirm it with a needs analysis. Update the policy register to clear a gap.$kb175$, $kb176$[{"storageKey":"/kb/protection-gap.jpg","caption":"Clients with no life or health cover, with indicative cover needed and AUM.","alt":"Clients with no life or health cover, with indicative cover needed and AUM."}]$kb176$::jsonb, 2, true, now(), 20
