SELECT 'Guide', f.id, $kb424$guide-settings$kb424$, $kb425$Settings — set up your firm$kb425$, $kb426$A map of Settings: your account, firm, team, clients and data, automation, messaging, connections and dashboards.$kb426$, $kb427$Settings is where the firm is set up. Use the search box at the top — for example "logo", "2FA" or "WhatsApp".

![Settings](shot:1)

## Your account

- **My profile** — your name, photo and signature image, used in email sign-offs.
- **Two-factor authentication** — turn it on to secure your login.

## Firm

- **Organisation profile** — the firm's name, ARN, logo and address.
- **Appearance & theme** and **Billing & subscription**.

## Team

- **Team & roles**, **Teams within a branch**, **Targets & quota** and **Auto-assignment rules**.

## Clients & data

- **Custom fields**, **Dropdown options**, **Onboarding form fields**, **Risk profile questionnaire**, **Scheme master** and **AMC empanelments**.

## Automation

- **Automations**, **Stages & journeys**, **Task templates**, **Escalation** and **QA sampling**.

## Messaging

- **Message templates**, **Email introduction** (what your firm says about itself in emails) and **Message log**.

## Connections

- **WhatsApp**, **Email** and **Integrations**. Connecting WhatsApp creates and submits the required template set to Meta for approval.

## Dashboards

- **Default dashboards** and **Dashboard thresholds**.

Most settings are for the owner; the rest follow each person's permissions.$kb427$, $kb428$[{"storageKey":"/kb/settings.jpg","caption":"Settings, grouped by what you want to do.","alt":"Settings, grouped by what you want to do."}]$kb428$::jsonb, 4, true, now(), 62
  FROM kb_folders f WHERE lower(f.slug) = $kb429$guide-settings$kb429$
ON CONFLICT (lower(slug)) DO UPDATE
   SET folder_id = EXCLUDED.folder_id, title = EXCLUDED.title, hook = EXCLUDED.hook, solution_md = EXCLUDED.solution_md,
       screenshots = EXCLUDED.screenshots, read_minutes = EXCLUDED.read_minutes, published = true,
       published_at = now(), sort_order = EXCLUDED.sort_order, updated_at = now()
 WHERE kb_articles.series = 'Guide' AND kb_articles.published = false AND kb_articles.screenshots = '[]'::jsonb;

